# Project-Specific Overrides (template)

Copy to `projects.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in per-repo notes. Detection
already finds the solution/frontend paths generically — use this only for extra
hints the skill can't infer. The active project's own CLAUDE.md wins on conflict.

**<RepoName>:**
- Solution: `<path/to/Solution.slnx>`        # usually auto-detected
- Frontend: `<path/to/frontend>`             # usually auto-detected
- Migration doc: `<docs/your-migration.md>`  # also set MIGRATION_DOC in .n2i-dev-cycle.env
- Legacy reference: `<old/>` (port logic, don't import)
- Notes: anything repo-specific Claude should know
